### AI Agent Reminders

- ALWAYS verify filter exists before using
- Check filter type signatures for chaining
- Never assume parentheses or ternary operators work
- Validate inputs before using filters (prevent silent failures)
- Check array size before accessing first/last
- Use `blank` for null checks, not `nil` or `empty`
- Remember: prices are in cents, not dollars
- Always pass variables explicitly to `{% render %}`
- Prefer explicit boolean checks over truthy/falsy assumptions
